      "review_description": "Xantor at Energo was a pleasure to have onsite. His work ethic and dedication to detail was a credit. He took the time to explain any issues of which I was unsure. I had 3 quotes for the stand alone system and his was the best due to searching for 2nd hand batteries hence coming in on budget. I was aware of the Sunny Island Boy he used, German.  I am recommending him to others as our new reverse cycle air con is running from the batteries on a frosty morning in Bega; sunny day expected.My system in 3.5kW East and West, 2.25kW North and 48x2volt Fiaam VRSLA absorbtion batteries. We have enough power to dull the sun.CheersPeter",
